  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empower South African children with reading skills</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Youth4Literacy (Y4L) objective is to place reading assistants in each Grade 2/3 classroom in 22 schools in the Western Cape. Each classroom receives a box of storybooks and readers and each child in the class receives two or three paired reading sessions a week and has at least two stories read to class each week. In addition, each child is encouraged to read at home through the promotion of our data-free Storytime with Shine Mobi-Site and the provision of a quarterly @Home pack.</narrative>
  </description>
